From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 17:39:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Forward member events to the PauseAI CRM (opt-in)

When CRM_WEBHOOK_URL and CRM_WEBHOOK_SECRET are set, PauseBot posts signed
member.joined, member.roles_updated and member.left events to the CRM's
/api/webhooks/pausebot endpoint. The signature is HMAC-SHA256 over
"<timestamp>.<body>", sent in X-PauseBot-Signature / X-PauseBot-Timestamp.

Unset means off, and a CRM failure is logged and never affects onboarding:
the call is fire-and-forget with three short retries on 5xx.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KhUdV6Uy3wrkfNomR3bZw2
---
 .env.example |  5 ++++
 README.md    |  2 ++
 main.py      | 64 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 71 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
index 61c2f38..3ba2265 100644
--- a/.env.example
+++ b/.env.example
@@ -12,3 +12,8 @@ DEVELOPER_MODE=false
 
 # Secret token to authenticate incoming webhooks from Airtable
