+   - `CRM_WEBHOOK_URL`, `CRM_WEBHOOK_SECRET`: (Optional) Where to send signed member events for the PauseAI CRM. Signature: HMAC-SHA256 of `<timestamp>.<body>`, sent in `X-PauseBot-Signature` / `X-PauseBot-Timestamp`.
 
